<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz GDP 0.6 pct up in Jan-Feb'97 vs 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz GDP 0.6 pct up in Jan-Feb'97 vs 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 0.6 percent in the first two months of 1997, compared to the same period last year, the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP		    Jan-Feb '97	    Jan-Feb '96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	+0.6		     +0.1</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
